  "$comment": "Domains blocked outright (never fetched). A bare host is an exact match; '*.example.com' matches that host plus any subdomain. 'endpoints' block specific paths on otherwise-safe hosts; 'wildcard' extends an endpoint rule to all subdomains, 'exact' lists exact pathnames, 'prefixes' list path prefixes. 'paths' blocks paths on ANY host. Edit freely.",
